+# Deploying the Base USDC Tip Jar
+
+These commands prepare a production static build for IPFS. Do not run the upload commands until the generated `out/` directory has been reviewed.
+
+## 1. Deploy the Contract to Base
+
+```bash
+yarn deploy --network base --keystore <foundry-keystore-name>
+```
+
+This broadcasts to Base mainnet and regenerates `packages/nextjs/contracts/deployedContracts.ts` with the Base deployment. The deployer becomes the tip recipient.
+
+Verify the deployed contract before building the site:
+
+```bash
+TIP_JAR=0xYourBaseTipJar
+BASE_RPC_URL=${BASE_RPC_URL:-https://mainnet.base.org}
+
+cast call $TIP_JAR "BASE_USDC()(address)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+cast call $TIP_JAR "recipient()(address)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+cast call $TIP_JAR "tipCount()(uint256)" --rpc-url $BASE_RPC_URL
+```
+
+`BASE_USDC()` must return `0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`.
+
+## 2. Build a Static IPFS Export
+
+Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_PRODUCTION_URL` to the final public origin users will load. For DNSLink or a custom gateway, use that stable origin. For a raw gateway-only release, set it to the gateway path after you know the CID and rebuild once before the final upload.
+
+```bash
+cd packages/nextjs
+node --version # must be >=20.9.0
+rm -rf .next out
+
+NEXT_PUBLIC_TARGET_NETWORK=base \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_IPFS_BUILD=true \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_RPC_URL=${BASE_RPC_URL:-https://mainnet.base.org} \
+NEXT_PUBLIC_PRODUCTION_URL=https://your-production-origin.example \
+yarn build
+```
+
+Confirm the static files exist:
+
+```bash
+test -f out/index.html
+find out -maxdepth 2 -name index.html | sort
+```
+
+## 3. Upload to IPFS
+
+Using the project dependency `bgipfs`:
+
+```bash
+cd packages/nextjs
+yarn bgipfs upload config init -u https://upload.bgipfs.com
+CID=$(yarn bgipfs upload out | awk '/CID:/ {print $2}' | tail -n 1)
+test -n "$CID"
+echo "$CID"
+```
+
+Using a local Kubo node instead:
+
+```bash
+cd packages/nextjs
+CID=$(ipfs add -Qr --cid-version=1 out | tail -n 1)
+test -n "$CID"
+echo "$CID"
+```
+
+## 4. Post-Deploy Verification
+
+```bash
+GATEWAY=https://community.bgipfs.com
+curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -L "$GATEWAY/ipfs/$CID/"
+curl -sL "$GATEWAY/ipfs/$CID/" | rg "Tip Jar|Base USDC"
+curl -sL "$GATEWAY/ipfs/$CID/" | rg "https://your-production-origin.example"
+curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -L "$GATEWAY/ipfs/$CID/debug/"
+```
+
+Expected HTTP status for the root and `/debug/` route is `200`.
+
+Finally, connect a wallet on Base, confirm the app shows the deployed `USDCTipJar` address, and send a small USDC tip only after the production contract address and recipient have been reviewed.
